Package: InSituTree
Title: Run Hierarchical Cell Typing
Version: 0.9
Authors@R: 
    c(person("Claire", "Williams", , "Claire.Williams@bruker.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
      person("Mark", "Gregory", , "mgregory@nanostring.com", role = c("aut")))
Description: InSituTree is a package that builds on the InSituType package to perform cell typing on 
      single cell spatial trasncriptomics data. It performs supervised cell typing in a hierarchical
      manner, only considering genes likely to be good at differentiating the cell types or subtypes
      being assessed.
